k/>3. Placebo: n = 24</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ADAS-cog, CIBIC-plus, NOSGER<break/>Adverse events</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b54-ndt-3-211">R&#x000f6;sler 1999</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RCT, parallel, double- blind, multicenter</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">26 weeks</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1. Rivastigmine 1&#x02013;4 mg: n = 243<break/>2. Rivastigmine 6&#x02013;12 mg: n = 243<break/>3. Placebo: n = 239</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">ADAS-cog, CIBIC-plus, PDS<break/> Adverse events</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b7-ndt-3-211">Bullock 2005</xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">RCT, parallel, double- blind, multicenter</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">24 months</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1. Rivastigmine 3&#x02013;12 mg: n = 498<break/>2. Donepezil 5&#x02013;10 mg: n = 500</td><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">SIB<break/>ADCS-ADL, GDS,NPI<break/>Adverse events</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-ndt-3-211"><p><bold>Abbreviations:</bold> ADAS-cog, Alzheimer&#x02019;s Disease Assessment Scale; CIBIC-Plus, Clinician&#x02019;s Interview Based Impression of Change; GDS, Global Deterioration Scale; NPI, neuropsychiatric inventory; NOSGER, Nurses Observations Scale for Geriatric Patients; PDS, Progressive Deterioration Scale; RCT, randomized controlled trial; b(t)id, 2 (3) times in one day; n, number of treated individuals; SIB, severe impairment battery.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>